          <div class="blog__author__content">
            <p class="blog__author__name">Chris Knight</p>
            <p class="blog__author__title">Director of insurance</p>
            <div class="blog__author__summary">						<p>Chris Knight outlines our expectations for firms on vertically integrated insurance.</p>
			</div>
